  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Little beings supposedly keep journals to record things. Right? Okay. This is mine. I'm Khe, a blue supergiant star pretending to be an insane cat-person. Dear reader: If you share this with anyone without my permission you will find out what it's like to be entombed in a vat of ^gray;molten^reset; metal.",
    "value": "渺小生灵惯以日记载事。然否？且罢。此乃我的日记。我名溪，伪作痴狂猫奴的蔚蓝超巨星。敬告阅者：若擅传此文，汝当亲尝葬身^gray;熔融^reset;金属铸棺之滋味。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Day 1 at the outpost - I don't keep track of days. But the first day I was aware was...interesting. I was asleep, then I was awake. A star, sentient. These little creatures laugh when I ask about it, despite the existence of the Novakid. 'Do stars think?'",
    "value": "在前哨站的第1天 - 我从不计数时日。但觉醒之初日...颇有趣味。我曾沉睡，继而苏醒。身为有识之星辰。每当我问及此事，那些渺小生灵总会发笑，尽管星之子确然存在。\"星辰会思考吗？\""
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Day 2 - I realized the concept of ^gray;time^reset; is something smaller beings are obsessed with. They measure it, quantify it, yet far too often lose track of its passing and all too often they fade before my core pulses once. Still getting used to that.",
    "value": "第2天 - 我察觉到^gray;时间^reset;乃是渺小生灵执迷之物。他们度量它，计数它，却常在流转中迷失，更常在我的星核初次搏动前便已消逝。尚在适应此般认知。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Day 3 - I wonder if the beings at this outpost realize that my catlike antics and simplemindedness are a facade? If they knew what I was, they might ask me to leave. Not like any of them could make me...",
    "value": "第3天 - 我思忖着，前哨站的生灵们可曾察觉，我那些猫科动物般的滑稽举止与单纯表象不过是伪装？倘若他们知晓我的本质，或许会请我离去。当然...他们之中无人能真正驱使我..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "Day 11 - The one called 'Kevin' amuses me. He studies sciences far beyond what any of these other scientists do, but wastes much of his potential on entertaining himself with foolish pranks. He attempted one such prank on me. A ^gray;box full of wolves^reset; as a 'welcome gift'. They were scrawny and didn't taste good.",
    "value": "第11天 - 那个名为\"凯文\"的个体令我颇觉玩味。他的科学造诣远超同侪，却将大半潜质耗费在自娱的愚蠢恶作剧上。今日他竟试图以^gray;装满饿狼的箱子^reset;作为\"欢迎礼\"来戏弄我。那些狼瘦骨嶙峋，尝来也索然无味。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "Day 14 - Another prank...a ^gray;briefcase full of bees^reset;. Kevin didn't seem amused when I returned them, mixed into cartons of orange juice. Claimed I was infringing on a patent. I thought his was sour milk and bees? According to the poorly guarded infraction log it was, anyway.",
    "value": "第14天 - 又一场闹剧...这次是^gray;装满蜜蜂的公文箱^reset;。当我把它们混进橙汁盒退还时，凯文似乎并不觉得有趣。他声称我侵犯了某项专利。我原以为他装的是酸乳与蜂群？至少根据守卫潦草的违规记录来看，确是如此。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/6",
    "raw": "Day 17 - Kevin brought me a gift...a surprisingly good one, this time. An entire pallet of gold bars. An hour later one of the humans barged in demanding they be returned. Offered them a piece I'd sculped into a crude poptop penis and said 'Kevin give shiny!' That prompted them to walk out of the room while yelling obscenities.",
    "value": "第17天 - 凯文今日赠礼...倒是出人意料地讨喜。整托盘的黄金锭。一小时后有人类闯进来索还，我递去用泡泡糖雕成的粗陋阳具模型，学着稚童腔调说：\"凯文送亮晶晶！\"那人只得骂骂咧咧摔门而去。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/7",
    "raw": "Day 23 - So it would appear Kevin knows what I am. He came in with a small scale solar system, entirely made of densinium, but had replaced the sun at the center with an obsidian sculpture of me. He then bombarded me with questions, asking what I knew of various eldritch or precursor beings and whether I had ever eaten people, among other things. He was...oddly polite, except that last question. Does he think I'll eat someone?",
    "value": "第23天 - 凯文似乎勘破了我的本质。他携来微缩星系，通体由致密金属铸就，却将中央恒星换作我的黑曜石塑像。随后连番追问，谈及诸多不可名状之物与先驱生灵，最后竟问我可曾食人。此人态度诡谲有礼，唯独末问唐突。莫非他当真以为我会噬人？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/8",
    "raw": "Day 24 - Found out why Kevin was so polite when asking questions. I caught him trying to make written copies on sections of human skin. Gave him a choice: get more technical knowledge of certain ^gray;precursor^reset; machines, or publish the recordings and watch as his replication terminal gets swallowed whole. He chose the precursor tech.",
    "value": "第24天 - 终解凯文昨日谦恭之疑。此人竟以人皮为纸，篆录秘文。我予他抉择：或得^gray;先驱^reset;机械精要，或任录音公诸于世，眼睁睁看复制终端被虚空吞噬。他择前者，指尖抚过皮卷纹理时，恍若触及禁忌的颤栗。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/9",
    "raw": "Day 25 - Kevin's a quick study. Learned how to reactivate the stasis systems and used them to store poptops. Oddly amusing, up until he let them out in the dining room. The florans went ^gray;hungry^reset; tonight.",
    "value": "第25天 - 凯文悟性惊人。竟能重启停滞系统，将吐舌娃封存其中。本觉光怪陆离颇有趣味，岂料他纵容它们在餐厅肆虐。今夜叶族人面对空荡餐盘，怕是只能^gray;以风露果腹^reset;了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/10",
    "raw": "Day 28 - Several days of work later, we managed to rework the ^gray;precursor stasis system^reset; into a limited form of time travel. Kevin is testing it, but he can't seem to go further than his most recent respawn. He did, however, promise to keep my secret if we could work on something together. Wouldn't say what.",
    "value": "第28天 - 历经数日雕琢，终将^gray;先驱停滞系统^reset;重构为有限时迁装置。凯文试之，却困于最近重生节点不得逾越。然此人立约：若允其共研秘术，便守我本源之秘。问及所求何事，笑而不语。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/11",
    "raw": "Day 35 - A week after our last project, Kevin brought in papers detailing an idea he'd had; ^gray;cheating spacetime to re-use certain devices continually^reset;. I suggested simple duplication, and he just patted my head and said 'silly kitty, tricks are for kids'.",
    "value": "第35天 - 距前次实验七日，凯文携卷宗而来，详述其妄念：^gray;以欺时空之法，令特定装置可循环往复永动不竭^reset;。我提议仿制之术，他却轻拍吾首笑叹：“傻猫，这只是小孩玩的把戏”。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/12",
    "raw": "Day 39 - We managed to get a working prototype, though Kevin kept trying to ^gray;feed me^reset; the materials we were working with. Kept having to remind him we needed them for the generator. A pity, they would have fed me for a few centuries at minimum.",
    "value": "第39天 - 工程雏形初现，然凯文执意欲将^gray;核心材料充作我食^reset;。屡次告诫此物乃供能之基，此人仍嬉笑捻起晶石在眼前晃荡。可惜了，这些能量晶体若作食粮，足以维系我辈千年之需。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/13",
    "raw": "Day 41 - Seems Kevin outdid himself. Everyone, himself included, had their gravity reversed. I had to remove the ^gray;precursor gravitic node^reset; he had placed in one of our generators. Didn't enjoy faking a physics field tech, but the others believed the response of 'Want pretty ball!' so I didn't have to explain anything. They just blamed Kevin.",
    "value": "第41天 - 凯文此番竟将己身也卷入涡旋。众人重力场皆呈倒悬之态，我不得不从他嵌入发电机的^gray;先驱引力节点^reset;中剥离异常能量。虽不齿伪造物理场象之术，然众人皆信那“我就是想玩球！”的托词。也好，省却唇舌解释，横竖罪责皆归这狂人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/14",
    "raw": "Day 45 - Kevin came in and asked how I managed to fit in my shell if I was so fat. So much for his earlier politeness...I told him 'Suck it in, fatty bug.' He seemed pleased at the answer for some reason...",
    "value": "第45天 - 凯文踱入实验室，突问：\"你胖成这样，怎么缩进甲壳里的？\"先前那点虚伪礼数终是装不下去了。我答道：\"吸息敛形，肥虫。\"不知何故，此人竟对此答露出醺然之态..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/15",
    "raw": "Day 61? Or is it 71? - Decided to try brewing today, since that drunk barkeep seems to love booze. Got distracted and forgot Kevin was coming by. Naturally, he wanted to 'contribute'...and proceeded to dump ^gray;phase matter^reset; and a few other things into my distilled ^gray;soulleaf^reset;. I told him not to drink it, so naturally he did the opposite. Now he's ^gray;walking through people^reset; and shouting 'Boo!'. Hilarious. Calling it Soulleaf Spritz.",
    "value": "第61天？或者是第71天？ - 今日试酿新酒，念及那酒保贪杯，遂取魂叶蒸馏。怎料疏漏间忘却凯文将至。此人见状，竟以^gray;相物质^reset;混入^gray;魂叶精华^reset;谓曰\"助兴\"。吾告诫勿饮，这狂徒偏要仰头尽灌。此刻正^gray;穿墙过壁^reset;，逢人便呼“砰！”。妙极，此酒当名\"魂叶惊鸿\"。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/16",
    "raw": "Day 1 (Again) - Decided to start over the day counter. Saw new visitors today. Well, one wasn't new. Apparently, I needed to tell my past self that 'Kevin is stuck again'. Turns out, he was stuck partway in the ceiling. Maybe I shouldn't share that new recipe with just anyone.",
    "value": "第1天（重来） - 重置计时罢。忽见访客至。其中一位倒算不得新面孔。不得不对昔日自身传讯：“凯文又卡住了。”抬头果见此人半身嵌于穹顶，如琥珀困蝇。早知那新配方不该轻传..."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/17",
    "raw": "Day 3 - New person from yesterday arrived again. Kevin sent them for oranges. Decided to follow them. Maybe they'll toss a few snacks in their extraction equipment? Mmm...^gray;ancient gold coins and avolite crystals^reset;, with a bottle of something special, maybe? Kevin left some ^gray;weird seeds^reset; for me to try growing. Definitely weren't ^gray;orange tree^reset; seeds.",
    "value": "第3天 - 昨日新客复至，凯文竟遣其寻橙。尾随其后，暗忖或能得些意外之财。果见其从萃取仪中抖落^gray;古金币与阿沃斯晶石^reset;，更有琉璃瓶盛异色琼浆。凯文留^gray;诡谲种子^reset;嘱我栽种，观其纹路幽光，断非^gray;橙树^reset;之属。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/18",
    "raw": "Day 17 - Along comes Kevin waving about his hands, then \"Suck it in, fat kitty\" he said...and threw a ^gray;neutron bomb^reset; at me. Nice snack. Then he asked me if I wanted to see a magic trick. Couldn't resist...said yes. What was the trick? He fired an ^gray;Atom Smasher^reset; at that annoying Fenerox in the market, ^gray;without seemingly having one^reset;. Gave me the ^gray;blueprint^reset; and said \"For Science!\" Also, he set the noisemaker's respawn delay to a week.",
    "value": "第17天 - 凯文张牙舞爪而来，忽喝\"肥猫，吸气！\"，竟将^gray;中子弹^reset;作零嘴掷我。吞罢核火，他又邀观戏法。鬼使神差应下，却见他朝市集耳廓狐虚指，^gray;原子粉碎机^reset;竟^gray;凭空现形^reset;。事后塞来^gray;蓝图^reset;道\"为科学献身\"，复将噪音发生器重生周期延至七日。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/19",
    "raw": "Day 18 - Should have guessed Kevin had an ulterior motive. I had to correct the blueprint, his design was ^gray;unstable^reset;. Found one of his bodies exploded in one of the vents, mixed with his Atom Smasher. He didn't seem too upset by it.",
    "value": "第18天 - 早该料到此獠另有图谋。其绘制的蓝图;能量回路^gray;极不稳定^reset;，只得连夜修正。晨间巡检，果见凯文某具躯壳炸裂于通风管道，残骸与原子粉碎机熔作一团。此人却浑不在意。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/20",
    "raw": "Day 19 - Apparently, a week is two days. That damn squeaker is back and keeps trying to sell me their garbage. No, I do not want to buy a used fur throw! Did manage to reverse-engineer the ^gray;orange^reset; Kevin gave me. Some 'dare' that was.",
    "value": "第19天 - 方知此间七日竟缩水为昼夜轮回。那恼人的尖嗓商贩复至，执意推销其废旧皮草。正烦躁间，忽忆起凯文所赠^gray;橙子^reset;，拆解方见果肉中嵌着微型跃迁引擎。所谓赌约，原是这般险恶机关。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/21",
    "raw": "Day 26 - Kevin has been missing a week. Not unheard of, but usually he leaves something to keep people busy. This time he's just...absent.",
    "value": "第26天 - 凯文已失踪七日。虽非首例，然此人向来会留些事务教人忙碌。此番却只是……纯粹的缺席。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/22",
    "raw": "Day 27 - He made a copy of ^gray;my gun^reset;...and the damn thing spews ^gray;gregisms^reset; like it's a birthday party. He also claims he mass-produced ^gray;cheap knockoffs^reset; to distract the 'peasants', but ^gray;I worry^reset; that they might end up back here. We don't need another ^gray;Greg infestation^reset;, even if ^gray;he^reset; claims he made failsafes against it.",
    "value": "第27天 - 他竟复刻了^gray;我的配枪^reset;...那该死之物如生日礼花般迸射^gray;格雷格的口音^reset;。此人还扬言大规模生产^gray;廉价仿品^reset;用以迷惑\"乡民\"，然^gray;我忧心^reset;这些玩意终将回流至此。吾等可承不住^gray;格雷格再度泛滥^reset;，纵使^gray;他自称设有防护机制^reset;。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/23",
    "raw": "Day 34 - Bubblegum. Why did it have to be bubblegum? At least he knew better than to drop any on me...but almost everyone else in the Science Outpost is stuck to the ceiling. Squeaker got stuck in an outhouse, though. Either Kevin got annoyed, or someone is reading my journal again.",
    "value": "第34天 - 泡泡糖。为何偏是此物？幸而此人尚知避开我身...然科研前哨众人皆被黏于天花板上。唯尖叫者困于厕中。若非凯文生怒，便是有谁又在偷阅我的日志。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/24",
    "raw": "Day 35 - No bubblegum for me, instead he brought the outpost's entire supply of gold, in molten form, and dropped it on me while I was napping under the bridge. Then proceeded to warn everyone of the 'dangerous moat monster' for the rest of the day, while I was enjoying the warmth. I think only he is laughing this time, though.",
    "value": "第35天 - 未遭泡泡糖之灾，却逢此人将前哨全部存金熔为液态，趁我于桥下小憩时倾覆其身。待我正享暖意之际，此人竟整日警示众人提防\"护城河妖物\"。想来此番窃笑者，唯他一人而已。"
  }
]